    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "## Browser Scavenger Hunt\r\n\r\nLet's explore this weather app's data! \r\n\r\nClick the 'Inspect Fetch Request' button to find the raw JSON file. Then answer the scavenger hunt questions in your activity guide.\r\n",
